OL,3,GNEWSAHow a seaside town realised it
OL,4,Aneeded public loos
OL,5,
OL,6,FEastbourne has a fascinating history
OL,7,Fwith one of life's most basic
OL,8,Famenities: the toilet.
OL,10,FIn the Victorian era, as the town grew
OL,11,Ffrom a small settlement into one of
OL,12,FBritain's most fashionable seaside
OL,13,Fresorts, thousands of tourists arrived
OL,14,Fby train each year.
OL,16,FBut the number of toilets did not match
OL,17,Fthe number of visitors and a popular
OL,18,Fboat race in 1870 laid bare the lack of
OL,19,Ffacilities.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
