OL,3,GNEWSAHow a seaside town realised it
OL,4,Aneeded public loos
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's said that over 1,000 people used
OL,7,Fa small stable near the pier to go the
OL,8,Ftoilet," historian Kevin Gordon told
OL,9,FSecret Sussex.
